      <data key="d8">["If you’ re using Claude Code to write your tools, it helps to give Claude documentation for any software libraries, APIs, or SDKs ( including potentially the MCP SDK) your tools will rely on.", "Claude 3.7 Sonnet and Claude Code \\ Anthropic\nToday, we’ re announcing Claude 3.7 Sonnet1, our most intelligent model to date and the first hybrid reasoning model on the market.", "Alongside Claude 3.7 Sonnet, Anthropic unveiled Claude Code, an agentic coding tool in research preview."]</data>
