      <data key="d8">["If you’ re using Claude Code to write your tools, it helps to give Claude documentation for any software libraries, APIs, or SDKs ( including potentially the MCP SDK) your tools will rely on.", "Claude, like Cline and Goose, can integrate with Model Context Protocol ( MCP), an open standard for connecting LLMs with sources of data.", "An MCP client can be an LLM like Claude, IDEs like Cursor and Windsurf, and various other tools ( such as SpinAI, a TypeScript framework for building AI agents)."]</data>
