      <data key="d8">["The Gemini app becomes more agentic, delivering proactive, 24/7 help\nGemini is becoming a more helpful AI assistant, with an intuitive new UI, proactive daily briefs and Gemini Spark, an agent to help you get things done around the clock.", "I followed the Google I/O Keynote in detail and while Gemini was definitely the star of the show ( Gemini is basically everywhere) Gemini Spark was the new product that really jumped out.", "Google CEO Explains 6 ‘ Big’ AI And Gemini Launches At Google I/O Keynote\nFrom Google’ s new Gemini Omni and Gemini 3.5 Flash to its new Gemini Spark agent and Google Antigravity 2.0, Google CEO Sundar Pichai explains the significant innovation launched at Google I/O 2026 this week."]</data>
