      <data key="d8">["I spoke with Benioff, the CEO and co-founder of cloud computing pioneer and enterprise applications giant, in advance of the general availability of the San Francisco company’ s Agentforce AI technology for sales and service.", "Benioff said the San Francisco-based customer relationship management ( CRM) vendor’ s Agentforce AI product on the Help.Salesforce.com portal and other parts of the company will “ deflect between a quarter and a half of our annual case volume, and in optimistic cases, probably much, much more. ”", "Benioff is serious about agentic AI, launching Agentforce last year to bring millions of AI agents to Salesforce customers."]</data>
