      <data key="d8">["In the two short years since OpenAI’ s release of ChatGPT, there has been a sprint from prompt-and-respond with pre-trained large language models to small language models, retrieval-augmented generation, and now agentic AI.", "Interestingly, the first paper on RAG was published in 2020 by researchers from Facebook AI Research ( now Meta AI), but it was not until the advent of ChatGPT that its potential was fully realized.", "Beyond Vector Search: 5 Next-Gen RAG Retrieval Strategies\nBeyond Vector Search: 5 Next-Gen RAG Retrieval Strategies Image by Editor | ChatGPT Retrieval augmented generation ( RAG) is now a cornerstone for building sophisticated large language model ( LLM) applications."]</data>
