      <data key="d8">["Salesforce Dreamforce 2024: The Biggest News\n“ We just don't see copilot as that key step for our future, ” Salesforce CEO Marc Benioff says.", "Salesforce CEO and co-founder Marc Benioff railed against copilot artificial intelligence products offered by Microsoft and other vendors, touting his company’ s agentic approach as one that delivers better accuracy while maintaining the importance of the vendor’ s services partners.", "Salesforce CEO and co-founder Marc Benioff continued his attacks on artificial intelligence rival Microsoft during the vendor’ s latest quarterly earnings call, calling Microsoft’ s Copilot AI offerings a rebranding of generative AI offered by Microsoft-backed OpenAI. “"]</data>
