      <data key="d8">["We don't see how that copilot world is going to get us to the real vision of artificial intelligence, of augmentation of productivity, of better business results that we 've been looking for, ” Benioff said. “", "Benioff is almost as strong in his negative sentiments toward Microsoft’ s Copilot.", "If anyone cared to plot a chart of our Copilot and agent news with Benioff’ s posts on X, you’ d find a relationship, ” Shaw said. “"]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
