      <data key="d8">["After DeepSeek, China takes a leap with Manus, world’ s first autonomous AI agent — TFN\nEmail address: By clicking submit, you agree to share your email address with TFN to receive marketing, updates, and other emails from the site owner.", "Manus AI Partners with Alibaba's Qwen: A New Chapter in Autonomous AI for Global Businesses\nManus AI, a Chinese startup, has collaborated with Alibaba's Qwen team to enhance its fully autonomous AI agent, Manus.", "Since the general AI agent Manus was launched last week, it has spread online like wildfire."]</data>
