      <data key="d8">["They should also make it an attractive proposition to continue building atop OpenAI’ s platform even in the face of rising competition from Chinese players like Manus, Alibaba’ s Qwen, DeepSeek and homegrown rivals such as Anthropic and Google.", "While this announcement might have been overshadowed by other AI headlines — Google’ s unveiling of the impressive open-source Gemma 3 model, and the emergence of Manus, a Chinese startup whose autonomous agent platform astonished observers — it is clearly a significant move for enterprises to be aware of.", "While many other major rival AI providers such as OpenAI, Google, and xAI that have launched “ Deep Research ” or “ Deep Researcher ” AI agents that conduct minutes or hours of extensive, in-depth web research and write well-cited, thorough reports on behalf of users, Manus is taking a different approach."]</data>
