      <data key="d8">["Just like its parent company’ s previous product, an AI assistant called Monica that was released in 2023, Manus is intended for a global audience.", "Chinese start-up Monica also launched its Manus AI agent, while startups introduced autonomous agents for DevSecOps use cases."]</data>
