      <data key="d8">["It’ s not clear just how impressive Manus actually is yet, but against this backdrop—the idea of agentic AI as a stepping stone toward AGI—it was fitting that New York Times columnist Ezra Klein dedicated his podcast on Tuesday to AGI.", "Marketed as a “ general AI agent that turns your thoughts into actions, ” Manus is gaining traction for its ability to complete complex tasks autonomously—outperforming leading agentic AI models like OpenAI’ s Deep Research and DeepSeek’ s R1.", "Seth Dobrin, co-founder and CEO of Arya Labs, said Manus was his favorite agentic AI platform, but his company, which develops a type of so-called world models, is no longer using it under Meta's ownership."]</data>
