      <data key="d8">["AI is advancing at light speed, from perception AI to generative AI and now agentic AI, ” said Huang. “", "Huang opened the event by reflecting on the tremendous progress in AI over the past year, spanning large language models, visual generative AI and physical AI for robotics — and outlining a vision for a future involving agentic AI models that are capable of reasoning and problem-solving. “", "In the agentic AI era, finally technology is reaching the point that we can transform from meeting to milestone, ” Zoom CTO Xuedong ( X.D.) Huang told VentureBeat in an exclusive interview."]</data>
