      <data key="d8">["A Deep Dive into the Agentic AI Taking on OpenAI and DeepSeek\nIn recent years, generative AI technology has dominated headlines, fueling a tech frenzy that led to a global AI arms race and what some call an industrial AI revolution.", "Building upon the foundations established by frontier models like GPT-4 and Deep Seek 3, agentic AI excels at complex reasoning, analyzing problems through multi-step processes, identifying critical elements, and developing logical action sequences to address challenges effectively.", "Even some of the excitement that accompanied the bombshell release of DeepSeek’ s low-cost, high-performance R1 model was sparked by its potential to exhibit reasoning behaviors that can set the stage for agentic AI."]</data>
