      <data key="d8">["In an opening keynote at the Splunk.conf25 customer and partner event in Boston Monday evening Cisco President and Chief Product Officer Jeetu Patel outlined a vision for how the combination of Cisco and Splunk technology—including the newly introduced Cisco Data Fabric—will help businesses and organizations move into the agentic AI era. “", "As such, Cisco Systems is advancing its industry-leading Webex collaboration platform by way of agentic AI to support these priorities, according to Jeetu Patel, Cisco’ s president and chief product officer. “"]</data>
