      <data key="d8">["Open-source experiments like AutoGPT, which simplify creating and managing AI agents, have attracted significant developer interest, growing to over 100,000 stars on GitHub.", "One of the criticisms of early AI agents, such as AutoGPT in 2023, was that they tried to do too much without human involvement.", "AutoGPT Explained: How to Build Self-Managing AI Agents\nAutoGPT is an open-source framework used to build autonomous AI agents that can decompose tasks, self-prompt and interact with tools."]</data>
