      <data key="d8">["Anthropic announces AI agents for complex tasks, racing OpenAI\nIn this article Anthropic, the Amazon-backed AI startup founded by former OpenAI research executives, announced Tuesday that it's reached an artificial intelligence milestone for the company: AI agents that can use a computer to complete complex tasks like a human would.", "If you haven't encountered the idea of an AI agent before – or if you see Large Language Models ( LLMs) like Claude and GPT as primarily chat services, OpenAI CEO Sam Altman might help put things in perspective.", "OpenAI Realtime API: The Missing Manual\nWe were invited to speak at OpenAI DevDay Singapore today ( video), and as part of our talk we worked on building a coding voice AI agent ( demo)."]</data>
