      <data key="d8">["If you haven't encountered the idea of an AI agent before – or if you see Large Language Models ( LLMs) like Claude and GPT as primarily chat services, OpenAI CEO Sam Altman might help put things in perspective.", "MCP is an open standard that acts as a bridge between AI agents ( like Claude, GPT, etc.)", "AI Agents’ growing traction is powered by Large Language Models ( LLMs) like GPT, which provide the ‘ brain’ for AI Agents to ask questions, reason, and give instructions to tools, people, and other Agents."]</data>
