      <data key="d7">["140411", "150678", "150930", "44995", "48429", "53867", "88348"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["If you haven't encountered the idea of an AI agent before – or if you see Large Language Models ( LLMs) like Claude and GPT as primarily chat services, OpenAI CEO Sam Altman might help put things in perspective.", "We believe that, in 2025, we may see the first AI agents ‘ join the workforce’ and materially change the output of companies, ” Sam Altman claimed in a blog post last week.", "In January, OpenAI CEO Sam Altman said, “ We believe that, in 2025, we may see the first AI agents ‘ join the workforce’ and materially change the output of companies. ”"]</data>
