      <data key="d7">["165463", "19900", "32810", "42151"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Jack Dorsey is back with Goose, a new, ultra-simple open-source AI agent-building platform from his startup Block\nJoin our daily and weekly newsletters for the latest updates and exclusive content on industry-leading AI coverage.", "From Docker Desktop to leading MCP clients like Docker AI Agent, Claude, continue.dev, Cursor, Goose, VS Code, and Windsurf, integrating powerful and capable AI agents into real workflows is about to get a whole lot easier.", "What Happens When a Public Company Goes All In on AI\nDavid Haber speaks with Owen Jennings, executive officer and business lead at Block, about how the company rebuilt itself around AI agents, small squads, and internal tools like Goose and Builder Bot after restructuring more than 40% of its workforce."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
