      <data key="d7">["165463", "65177"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Today Block launched Goose, a free, open-source framework that seeks to simplify the process of building an AI agent ( or many agents) with pretty much any conceivable large language model ( LLM) as the intelligence on the backend, whether that be DeepSeek or a proprietary model from the likes of OpenAI, Google or Anthropic.", "Suddenly, AI agents could navigate Block's massive codebase — hundreds of services, years of accumulated complexity — and make meaningful changes that actually passed CI and code review."]</data>
