      <data key="d7">["128331", "148412", "154226", "165463", "165519"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Today Block launched Goose, a free, open-source framework that seeks to simplify the process of building an AI agent ( or many agents) with pretty much any conceivable large language model ( LLM) as the intelligence on the backend, whether that be DeepSeek or a proprietary model from the likes of OpenAI, Google or Anthropic.", "Learn More Many of us in the AI and business worlds are focused — anecdotally and in terms of the number of articles and messages being written/posted — on OpenAI and DeepSeek, especially OpenAI’ s o3-powered Deep Research mode, a new reasoning AI agent that performs extensive web research on behalf of the user and compiles it into neat and tidy, well-cited reports.", "Learn More 2025 was, by many expert accounts, supposed to be the year of AI agents — task-specific AI implementations powered by leading large language and multimodal models ( LLMs) like the kinds offered by OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, and DeepSeek."]</data>
