      <data key="d8">["Inspired by Arthur Hastings, the meticulous assistant to Agatha Christie’ s detective Hercule Poirot, we built HAIstings to help infrastructure teams prioritize vulnerabilities based on: LangGraph, built on top of LangChain, provides an excellent framework for creating conversational AI agents with memory.", "Building ReAct Agents with LangGraph: A Beginner’ s GuideImage by Author ReAct ( Reasoning + Acting) is a common pattern for building AI agents that think through problems and take actions to solve them.", "From IDEs like VS Code, Cursor and JetBrains to AI agent frameworks like LangGraph, CrewAI, AWS’ strands, and Google’ s Agent Development Kit ( ADK), MCP is set to become a foundational layer for AI-native workflows."]</data>
