      <data key="d7">["42331"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Accenture Expands AI Refinery and Launches New Industry Agent Solutions to Accelerate Agentic AI Adoption\nNEW YORK and SAN JOSE: GTC 2025; March 18, 2025 – To help organizations accelerate the adoption of agentic functionality and reimagine functions and industry processes, Accenture ( NYSE: ACN) has expanded its AI Refinery™ platform with the launch of an AI agent builder that allows business users to quickly build and customize agents, enabling unprecedented agility."]</data>
