      <data key="d7">["154298", "155369", "172450", "180198", "45434", "51575", "51819", "74744", "81558"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Unlike a single-agent system, where one AI agent attempts to handle all aspects of a task in isolation, a multi-agent system distributes the workload among several specialized agents.", "At the heart of the announcements is Microsoft’ s new multi-agent system, which enables agents built with Copilot Studio, Microsoft 365, Azure AI Agents Service, and Azure Fabric to work together, delegating tasks to one another to complete complex business processes.", "Businesses are better off considering a MAS ( multi-agent system) approach, where tasks are distributed amongst multiple AI agents which verify each other’ s work."]</data>
