      <data key="d8">["CRN has collected Ramaswamy’ s boldest statements across his keynote speech and Summit-related press conferences, wherein the CEO–who’ s held his position for about 15 months–weighed in on channel partners, AI agents, his company’ s pending acquisition of Crunchy Data and more.", "At its Summit in New York today, AWS announced a slew of updates to its AI-centric services, but the most important news was definitely Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, a new platform ( now in preview) that brings together all of the services developers need to put AI agents into production and at scale, using any framework and model."]</data>
