      <data key="d6">4</data>
      <data key="d7">["40262", "40891", "40893", "40912"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Zscaler CEO Jay Chaudhry’ s Five Boldest Statements At Zenith Live 2025\nThe cybersecurity vendor is accelerating its expansion into security operations and enabling AI agents while also continuing to drive ‘ transformation’ with its partners, Chaudhry said during the company’ s conference.", "Zscaler CEO On Why Zero Trust Is The Real ‘ Foundation’ For Deploying AI Agents\nCrucially, when it comes to securing AI and agentic, ‘ we are putting a concerted effort to bring partners along in this journey—because they will be needed,’ Zscaler CEO Jay Chaudhry tells CRN.", "Zscaler Has ‘ Incredible Advantage’ For Securing AI Agent Boom: Partners\nThe cybersecurity vendor’ s combination of a broad customer base and zero trust system that can be naturally extended into agentic mean massive growth opportunities ahead for Zscaler partners, solution and service provider executives tell CRN."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ai_technology:ai-agent" target="person:chaudhry">
      <data key="d4">MENTIONED_WITH</data>
      <data key="d5">cooccurrence</data>
      <data key="d6">4</data>
      <data key="d7">["40262", "40880", "40891", "40893"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Zscaler CEO Jay Chaudhry’ s Five Boldest Statements At Zenith Live 2025\nThe cybersecurity vendor is accelerating its expansion into security operations and enabling AI agents while also continuing to drive ‘ transformation’ with its partners, Chaudhry said during the company’ s conference.", "During his keynote at Zscaler’ s Zenith Live 2026 conference in Las Vegas, Chaudhry said that while users have long been considered the biggest risk in security, AI agents are rapidly becoming the “ weakest link. ”", "In an interview with CRN, Chaudhry said the largest need right now for enabling secure deployment of AI agents is to protect the communications between agents."]</data>
