      <data key="d8">["Today at its New York Summit, AWS unveiled Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, a new enterprise-grade platform designed to build, deploy, and operate AI agents securely and at scale.", "At its Summit in New York today, AWS announced a slew of updates to its AI-centric services, but the most important news was definitely Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, a new platform ( now in preview) that brings together all of the services developers need to put AI agents into production and at scale, using any framework and model.", "AWS Launches AI Agents Marketplace And Bedrock AgentCore: AWS Exec On ‘ Huge’ Partner Opportunity\n‘ This is going to create a really huge opportunity for AWS partners as they’ re building agents and building assets to get them out into our co-sell motion and into the hands of customers,’ says AWS’ Brian Bohan regarding the new AI Agents Marketplace and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore."]</data>
