      <data key="d8">["OpenAI launches ChatGPT Atlas browser, Meta cuts 600 AI jobs: this week's news roundup\nOpenAI has launched an AI-driven web browser, ChatGPT Atlas in a move intended to challenge the traditional web browsing and search paradigm by integrating an AI agent.", "With all that interest, the researchers focused on 30 prominent AI agents across three separate categories: chat-based options like ChatGPT Agent and Claude Code; browser-based bots like Perplexity Comet and ChatGPT Atlas; and enterprise options like Microsoft 365 Copilot and ServiceNow Agent."]</data>
