      <data key="d8">["The AI chip and model vendor this week unveiled the SambaNova Cloud, a fast API service that runs on its SN40L AI chip and that developers can use when leveraging Meta’ s Llama 3.1 AI models, including the 405 billion parameter variant, the largest of the three open models that launched in July.", "Powerful models are a simple API call away and available to all ( as Meta and OpenAI ads make sure to remind us).", "You can also think of it as a meta-API, as this diagram from Matt Pocock illustrates: “ So MCP is a protocol and really a very thin layer above an API that says, here is the definition that this API needs to expose for the LLM or agent to be able to query and find out more about [ … ] whatever that data might be, ” Batchu explained."]</data>
