      <data key="d8">["Automate with infrastructure as codeUse Terraform or CloudFormation to declare your API gateway setup.", "In the traditional model, Infrastructure as Code ( IaC) sits in a multi-layer intent-to-execution stack: human intent ( architecture goals and requirements) is translated through an explicit interaction layer ( CLI commands, GitOps/CI workflows, pull requests, and UI processes) into an IaC abstraction ( for example CloudFormation, ARM templates/Bicep, Terraform HCL, modules, providers), which ultimately drives provider APIs ( AWS, Azure, GCP, and SaaS platforms)."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
