      <data key="d7">["124087", "143581", "143582", "148055", "154376", "154429", "165322", "32054", "63851"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["The road to AGI is long, with one key hurdle being the auto-regressive nature of LLM training that predicts words based on past sequences.", "The AI startup reportedly grew out of the hedge fund's AI research unit in April 2023 to focus on large language models and reaching artificial general intelligence, or AGI — a branch of AI that equals or surpasses human intellect on a wide range of tasks, which OpenAI and its rivals say they're fast pursuing.", "Of course there is a lot of discussion in this space and you’ d need to evaluate each individual statement to understand the full context of the point being made in each case, but the statements I’ ve seen recently that are dismissive about marketing hype are referring to statements by companies saying that AGI will happen essentially any minute now and be based on some tweaks to the current type of LLMs that have been released."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
