      <data key="d7">["144614"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["While the recent U.S. election was a turning point in many ways, it’ s easy to ignore how it coincided with a watershed moment for our society: AI is already here, and we’ ll likely see the dawn of artificial general intelligence, or AGI, in the next four years or so under the Trump administration."]</data>
