      <data key="d8">["No one has ever asked me about achieving AGI, let alone ASI. ''", "Since its inception, experts have charted AI’ s progress through three conceptual stages: narrow AI, AGI and ASI.", "With time, the integration of advanced AI frameworks—such as the AIRIS system and the groundbreaking OpenCog Hyperon AGI framework—is set to revolutionize the way immersive experiences are delivered across both Web3 and traditional gaming but also provide a robust long-term foundation for ASI: Create platform, empowering developers to deploy advanced AI Agents that unlock new interactive possibilities."]</data>
