      <data key="d8">["From the invention of the world’ s best personal AI assistant with Alexa, to developing AWS services like Connect, Lex, and Polly that are used across a wide range of industries, Amazon has long believed that voice-powered applications can make all of our customers’ lives better and easier, ” said Rohit Prasad, SVP of Amazon Artificial General Intelligence. “", "With a career spanning leadership roles at tech giants like Google and Amazon Web Services, Reddy brings a unique perspective to the ongoing conversation about artificial intelligence, its capabilities, limitations, and the tantalizing prospect of Artificial General Intelligence ( AGI)."]</data>
