      <data key="d7">["52926", "63780"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["In voice applications, this means I end up using a pipeline that includes speech-to-text ( STT, also known as ASR, or automatic speech recognition) to transcribe the user’ s words, then processes the text using one or more LLM calls, and finally returns an audio response to the user via TTS ( text-to-speech).", "To identify the best model for real-time on-device transcription, we conducted a systematic empirical study across over 50 configurations spanning encoder-decoder, transducer, and LLM-based ASR architectures — including OpenAI Whisper, NVIDIA Nemotron, Parakeet TDT, Canary, Conformer Transducer, and Qwen3-ASR — evaluated across batch, chunked, and streaming inference modes."]</data>
