      <data key="d8">["I like to keep it simple, and just recently, Andrej Karpathy introduced his idea about LLM Knowledge Bases.", "A common theme emerging from recent studies and projects such as the Stanford Meta-Harness paper, CMU’ s Externalization paper, Andrej Karpathy’ s LLM Wiki project ( which we cover later in this blog), and early foundational work on agent memory such as Google’ s Simulacra paper can be summarized as follows Early studies have shown that an average sized model with a better harness, memory, and systems implementation can well outperform a larger sized model that lacks a good harness and memory system around it."]</data>
