      <data key="d7">["106448", "51224", "69101", "69801", "85493"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["To learn all about RAG, check out LangChain: Chat with Your Data from DeepLearning.", "RAG infrastructure for generative AI using GKE and Cloud SQL\nThis document provides a reference architecture that you can use to design the infrastructure to run a generative AI application with retrieval-augmented generation ( RAG) using Google Kubernetes Engine ( GKE), Cloud SQL, and open source tools like Ray, Hugging Face, and LangChain.", "The LangChain community has implemented many of these, from simple prompting techniques like chain of density and step-back prompting, to advanced RAG techniques all the way to RL chains, generative agents, and autonomous agents like BabyAGI."]</data>
