      <data key="d7">["39982", "80360", "80695", "85548"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["The NVIDIA AI Blueprint for video search and summarization can be configured with NVIDIA NIM microservices for VLMs like NVIDIA VILA, LLMs like Meta’ s Llama 3.1 405B and AI models for GPU-accelerated question answering and context-aware retrieval-augmented generation.", "To foster development of AI PC applications on the new RTX 50 series and other recent generations of GeForce GPUs, Nvidia said it plans to release a “ pipeline ” of Nvidia NIM microservices and Nvidia AI Blueprints that use first- and third-party models to enable use cases ranging from PDF extraction, computer vision and speech to image generation, large language models and embedded models for retrieval-augmented generation.", "The VSS blueprint incorporates the NVIDIA AI Enterprise software platform, including NVIDIA NIM microservices for VLMs, LLMs and advanced AI frameworks for RAG."]</data>
