      <data key="d7">["165357", "165540", "165568"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Organizations that attempt to build agents on their own often struggle with retrieval augmented generation ( RAG) and vector databases, Forrester senior analyst Rowan Curran told VentureBeat.", "Chris Betz, CISO of AWS, told VentureBeat that retrieval-augmented generation ( RAG) and agentic use cases “ are a fascinating and interesting angle ” in security. “", "We knew that part of the solution would be a technique called RAG — retrieval-augmented generation, ” said Douwe Kiela, CEO and cofounder of Contextual AI, in an exclusive interview with VentureBeat. “"]</data>
