      <data key="d8">["In the two short years since OpenAI’ s release of ChatGPT, there has been a sprint from prompt-and-respond with pre-trained large language models to small language models, retrieval-augmented generation, and now agentic AI.", "DeepSeek’ s R1 and OpenAI’ s Deep Research just redefined AI — RAG, distillation, and custom models will never be the same\nJoin our daily and weekly newsletters for the latest updates and exclusive content on industry-leading AI coverage.", "Out-analyzing analysts: OpenAI’ s Deep Research pairs reasoning LLMs with agentic RAG to automate work — and replace jobs\nJoin our daily and weekly newsletters for the latest updates and exclusive content on industry-leading AI coverage."]</data>
