      <data key="d7">["153551", "59086", "69801"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["This is complemented by highly scalable object storage to manage the volume and variety of datasets critical to AI applications, and integration with leading vector database vendors, including Aiven and Milvus, to enable retrieval-augmented generation ( RAG).", "This talk will share insights into building image-text search and Composite Image Retrieval ( CIR) using multimodal embeddings and the Milvus open source vector database, demonstrating how multi-modality unlocks new use cases in RAG.", "Identify AI stacks: Advanced pattern matching inspects container images, environment variables, and command-line arguments to detect serving runtimes ( vLLM, Triton Inference Server, TGI, Ollama), autonomous agent frameworks ( LangChain, AutoGen, CrewAI), vector databases and RAG stores ( Milvus, Qdrant, pgvector), as well as distributed training jobs and evaluation harnesses."]</data>
