      <data key="d8">["In this blog post, I’ ll show you how to deploy your preferred open-weight LLM with Ollama in a Kubernetes cluster, and connect it to a Python application powered by LangChain.", "Identify AI stacks: Advanced pattern matching inspects container images, environment variables, and command-line arguments to detect serving runtimes ( vLLM, Triton Inference Server, TGI, Ollama), autonomous agent frameworks ( LangChain, AutoGen, CrewAI), vector databases and RAG stores ( Milvus, Qdrant, pgvector), as well as distributed training jobs and evaluation harnesses."]</data>
