      <data key="d7">["106502", "165506", "69728", "85487"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["LangChain mainly used pre-built ReAct agents through its LangGraph platform.", "Building ReAct Agents with LangGraph: A Beginner’ s GuideImage by Author ReAct ( Reasoning + Acting) is a common pattern for building AI agents that think through problems and take actions to solve them.", "AI service workforce is a customizable, LangGraph-based, ReAct agent, designed to automate and resolve inquiries across any enterprise service management use case."]</data>
