      <data key="d7">["147196", "161039"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Meanwhile, in a separate presentation at the World’ s Fair, LlamaIndex creator Jerry Liu pitched agents as the natural successor to RAG ( Retrieval-Augmented Generation), the most common method of integrating a pretrained LLM with an external data source.", "The DeepSeek Moment\nWe reached out to founders of five leading AI infrastructure companies in Greylock’ s portfolio—Devvret Rishi ( Predibase), Tuhin Srivastava ( Baseten), Ankur Goyal ( Braintrust), Jerry Liu ( LlamaIndex), and Alex Ratner ( Snorkel AI) —to get their take on DeepSeek and what it means for the future of open-source vs. closed models, AI infrastructure, and GenAI economics."]</data>
