      <data key="d7">["139862", "144043", "151049", "152358", "168273", "65075", "70618"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Clawdbot to Moltbot to OpenClaw: The AI agent generating buzz and fear globally\nIn this article Through several name changes, adoption across Silicon Valley to Beijing, and mounting controversy, the open-source AI agent now known as `` OpenClaw '' has emerged as one of the most talked-about tools in the artificial intelligence space this year.", "OpenClaw ( formerly Moltbot and ClawdBot) is a viral, open-source autonomous AI assistant designed to execute complex digital tasks, such as managing calendars, automating web browsing, and running system commands, directly from a user's local hardware.", "If not, you will have heard one of its previous names, Clawdbot or Moltbot."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
