      <data key="d8">["OpenClaw, which Huang described as the operating system for personal AI and the fastest-growing open-source project in history, was built for individuals.", "In his keynote, Huang described OpenClaw as the go-to option for building AI agents that can perform tasks like scouting eBay for deals and then placing bids, and said it `` exceeded what Linux did in 30 years '' in mere weeks.", "Hours after landing, Huang made a surprise visit to Meet-a-Claw, where NVIDIA and Taiwan’ s developer community gathered for an afternoon of demos, tech talks and networking — an opportunity to get hands on with autonomous agents and OpenClaw."]</data>
