      <data key="d8">["Day one of the summit, Agentic Commerce: The Final Frontier of Payments, featured Philip Bruno ( ACI Worldwide), Jelena Hoffart ( Mastercard), and Craig DeWitt ( Skyfire), who explored how agentic AI is automating financial decisions, transforming value chain engagement, and redefining competition in an AI-first payments ecosystem."]</data>
