      <data key="d7">["148562", "148563"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Day one of the summit, Agentic Commerce: The Final Frontier of Payments, featured Philip Bruno ( ACI Worldwide), Jelena Hoffart ( Mastercard), and Craig DeWitt ( Skyfire), who explored how agentic AI is automating financial decisions, transforming value chain engagement, and redefining competition in an AI-first payments ecosystem.", "The webinar featured leading voices in the payments industry—Philip Bruno ( ACI Worldwide), Gottfried Leibbrandt ( CLS Group), and Pat Patel ( GFTN) —who shared insights on the G20’ s payments vision, real-time initiatives, the importance of interoperability, barriers to integration, and the role of digital currencies in real-time payments."]</data>
