      <data key="d8">["OpenAI, Anthropic and others unite for Agentic AI Foundation\nA slew of high-profile tech companies have joined forces to launch the Agentic AI Foundation.", "Major players like Anthropic, OpenAI, and Block have banded together to establish the Agentic AI Foundation ( AAIF), a new entity under the Linux Foundation aimed at fostering open standards for AI agents.", "Earlier this month, Block, Anthropic, and OpenAI, in partnership with the Linux Foundation, announced the formation of the Agentic AI Foundation ( AAIF), bringing together contributions from their respective companies, with support from other AI leaders, to establish open standards for agentic AI."]</data>
