      <data key="d8">["Ahead of Mobile World Congress ( MWC), running March 2-5 in Barcelona, NVIDIA and Nokia announced new AI-RAN collaborations with top telecom operators across Europe, Asia and North America, powered by NVIDIA AI-RAN platforms.", "T-Mobile was the first in the U.S. to pilot NVIDIA’ s AI-RAN infrastructure with Nokia’ s anyRAN software and is now working with select NVIDIA physical AI partners, demonstrating how cell sites and mobile switching offices can support distributed edge AI workloads while continuing to deliver advanced 5G connectivity."]</data>
