      <data key="d7">["128952", "128961", "128965", "144633", "151061", "154246"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["And it was only in 2017 that an AI system ( Google DeepMind’ s AlphaGo) was able to beat the world’ s number one ranked player in Go, an ancient, abstract Chinese boardgame—almost 50 years after the first program attempting the task was written.", "ReflectionAI founder Ioannis Antonoglou: From AlphaGo to AGI\nIoannis Antonoglou, founding engineer at DeepMind and co-founder of ReflectionAI, has seen the triumphs of reinforcement learning firsthand.", "It was the move that defined the 2016 showdown between Go legend Lee Sedol and DeepMind’ s AI agent, AlphaGo."]</data>
