      <data key="d8">["ReflectionAI founder Ioannis Antonoglou: From AlphaGo to AGI\nIoannis Antonoglou, founding engineer at DeepMind and co-founder of ReflectionAI, has seen the triumphs of reinforcement learning firsthand.", "Ioannis Antonoglou, Reflection’ s cofounder and Deepmind founding engineer behind AlphaGo, recalls the moment vividly: “ Move 37 was spectacular … a brilliant, unconventional move that showed the system had a deep understanding of the game.", "The team lead, David Silver, was flanked on one side by DeepMind founder Demis Hassabis and on the other by Ioannis Antonoglou, the research engineer who accelerated the neural networks that made AlphaGo tick."]</data>
