      <data key="d8">["AWS has hired Microsoft Teams’ founding member and Microsoft innovator Jigar Thakkar as the leader of its new Amazon Quick", "By bringing Adobe Experience Platform Agent Orchestrator to AWS and integrating our marketing intelligence into Amazon Quick, we’ re enabling enterprises to uncover campaign insights in seconds—all while maintaining the enterprise-grade security and scale our customers demand, ” says Ankur Jain, Director of Product Management, Ecosystem Solutions, Adobe. “", "In a good example of enterprise agentic web, AWS and Adobe have connected Adobe’ s Marketing Agent to Amazon Quick via MCP — allowing marketing teams to query campaign performance, audiences and customer journeys through natural language."]</data>
