      <data key="d8">["AMD smashed its own expectations for first-quarter revenue in large part thanks to a 57 percent year-over-year increase in data center sales, which not only got a boost from its Instinct GPUs but also from its EPYC CPUs in the face of pent-up AI demand.", "We think that given the superior price/performance that AMD is offering with its current Epyc line that its over-demand might be even higher, perhaps 30 percent and growing as agentic AI takes hold and we see a resurgence in CPU capacity in the AI datacenter."]</data>
