      <data key="d8">["Snowflake Strikes Strategic Deal To Bring Anthropic’ s AI Models To Its AI Data Cloud\nSnowflake also announces key acquisition that will add advanced data integration capabilities to the Snowflake cloud platform to support structured and unstructured data.", "In October, Cloudera announced that Anthropic, Google Cloud, and Snowflake joined the Enterprise AI Ecosystem, along with founding members NVIDIA, Amazon Web Services ( AWS), and Pinecone.", "The Snowflake and Anthropic alliance, which Snowflake described as “ a significant expansion ” of its existing strategic partnership with the AI startup, also establishes a joint global go-to-market initiative focused on deploying AI agents to major customers."]</data>
