      <data key="d8">["Claude 3.7 Sonnet and Claude Code \\ Anthropic\nToday, we’ re announcing Claude 3.7 Sonnet1, our most intelligent model to date and the first hybrid reasoning model on the market.", "Claude 3.7 Just Raised The Bar For AI: Here’ s Why It’ s A Game-changer\nAnthropic has launched Claude 3.7, the world’ s first AI model capable of producing either standard output or a controllable amount of “ reasoning ” to address complex problems.", "Take Anthropic’ s latest breakthrough: Claude 3.7, the first hybrid reasoning model, delivering both lightning-fast responses and deep, step-by-step problem-solving."]</data>
