      <data key="d8">["The company also announced it has achieved the highest score to date on SWE-bench verified, an industry benchmark for AI coding capabilities, by combining Anthropic’ s Claude Sonnet 3.7 with OpenAI’ s O1 reasoning model. “", "RAG, as you’ ll recall, is the widely-used technique that enterprises and organizations can deploy to hook an AI large language model ( LLM) such as OpenAI’ s GPT-4o, Google’ s Gemini 2.5 Flash, Anthropic’ s Claude Sonnet 3.7 or Cohere’ s Command-A, or open source alternatives like Llama 4 and DeepSeek V3 to external knowledge bases, such as enterprise documents and cloud storages.", "For the time being, it is powered by Anthropic’ s Claude Sonnet 3.7, because, as Dohmke told me, the team believes that this model currently has “ the best mix of quality of the code and matching developer preference. ”"]</data>
