      <data key="d8">["Last week, Gemini 2.5 blew away AI benchmarks held by competitors like OpenAI and Anthropic.", "The AI Update Trap\nPosted on Dec 29, 2025 • Originally published at smarterarticles.co.uk on Mar 22 The game changed in May 2025 when Anthropic released Claude 4 Opus and Sonnet, just three months after Google had stunned the industry with Gemini 2.5's record-breaking benchmarks.", "Led by researchers Jeremy Schlatter, Benjamin Weinstein-Raun, and Jeffrey Ladish, the experiment tested several state-of-the-art large language models, including OpenAI's o3 and GPT-5, xAI's Grok 4, Google's Gemini 2.5 Pro, and Anthropic's Claude models."]</data>
