      <data key="d8">["Anthropic’ s Claude Sonnet and Opus large language models have long been favorites among developers, and today, the company is launching Claude Sonnet 4.5, the latest version of its mainstream model, which the company describes as the “ best coding model in the world. ”", "Anthropic alone shipped seven major model versions in 2025, starting with Claude 3.7 Sonnet in February, followed by Claude 4 Opus and Sonnet in May, Claude Opus 4.1 in August, and culminating with Claude Sonnet 4.5 in September and Claude Haiku 4.5 in October.", "Reuters) Anthropic’ s Interpretability team identified 171 distinct emotion-related representations in Claude Sonnet 4.5 that actively shape the model’ s behavior, organized similarly to human psychological structures."]</data>
