      <data key="d8">["In fact a hefty number of consumers, 70%, are using AI in their personal lives and nearly half, 45%, are using it daily compared to half that just nine months ago, according to a Bain &amp; Company's Consumer Lab AI survey that also revealed most consumers trust Gen AI for research.", "Numerator's `` 2026 Visions Report '' reveals a hefty number of consumers, 70%, are using AI in their personal lives and nearly half, 45%, are using it daily, according to a Bain &amp; Company's Consumer Lab AI survey that also revealed most consumers trust Gen AI for research and 17% of online shoppers will start holiday shopping with an AI platform."]</data>
