      <data key="d8">["From BASIC to Vibes: Microsoft's 50-Year Code Evolution\nWe’ re so glad you’ re here.", "I created my first graphic in 1981 using a language called “ BASIC ” on a computer by Texas Instruments called the TI-99/4A. The code to enter and run BASIC, by the way, was written by a new company at the time named Microsoft."]</data>
