      <data key="d7">["140386"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["While “ Blackwell ” GB200 NVL72 and GB300 NVL72 rackscale systems have radically improved Nvidia’ s cost per token, and future “ Rubin ” VB200 NVL72 machines coming later this year promise even better bang for the buck on mixture of expert models, the speed of inference from the CS-3 waferscale systems from Cerebras Systems or the GroqRack systems from Groq are usually better."]</data>
