      <data key="d8">["Cisco’ s Hyperscale And Cloud AI Push Will Give It Enterprise Clout\nMuch of the business that Cisco Systems and others have been doing in the AI infrastructure field since OpenAI lit the generative AI fuse with ChatGPT in November 2022 has been deploying hardware and software with the hyperscalers, a lucrative business that led company executives to promise to sell as much as $ 1 billion in back-end network technology by the end of its fiscal year and then to blow past that a quarter early."]</data>
