      <data key="d7">["52808"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["In the traditional model, Infrastructure as Code ( IaC) sits in a multi-layer intent-to-execution stack: human intent ( architecture goals and requirements) is translated through an explicit interaction layer ( CLI commands, GitOps/CI workflows, pull requests, and UI processes) into an IaC abstraction ( for example CloudFormation, ARM templates/Bicep, Terraform HCL, modules, providers), which ultimately drives provider APIs ( AWS, Azure, GCP, and SaaS platforms)."]</data>
