      <data key="d7">["147447", "147462", "148377", "80550"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["The session kicked off with CNCF CTO Chris Aniszczyk’ s discussion on the state of Kubernetes adoption and the CNCF annual meeting, which this year marks the 10th anniversary.", "At KubeCon + CloudNativeCon Europe, The New Stack sat down with Tyson Singer, head of platform and technology at Spotify, and Chris Aniszczyk, CTO of the CNCF, for an exclusive reflection on how Backstage grew from an internal dev portal into the open source framework with 89% market share.", "NVIDIA’ s deep collaboration with the Kubernetes and CNCF community to upstream the NVIDIA DRA Driver for GPUs marks a major milestone for open source Kubernetes and AI infrastructure, ” said Chris Aniszczyk, chief technology officer of CNCF. “"]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
