      <data key="d7">["119734", "154450", "55156"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["In a joint video posted to X featuring Cognition CEO Scott Wu and interim Windsurf CEO Jeff Wang, the leaders said they would start by integrating Cognition’ s autonomous AI-powered engineer Devin into Windsurf’ s IDE.", "Cognition Acquires Windsurf in a Game-Changing Move for AI-Powered Coding\nn a blockbuster move for the AI coding industry, Cognition, the startup behind the viral AI coding agent Devin, announced on Monday that it has signed a definitive agreement to acquire Windsurf, a leading innovator in agentic integrated development environments ( IDEs).", "Look at what happened with Cognition and Windsurf: Three weeks after acquiring Windsurf, Cognition laid off 30 employees and offered buyouts to the remaining 200 staff."]</data>
