      <data key="d8">["Founded in 2019, by ex-Google AI researchers, Cohere is valued in the billions of dollars and is one of the more high-profile names in the world of generative AI, which has exploded since OpenAI debuted ChatGPT in late 2022.", "The Mistral AI Agent Build Environment\nThe AI landscape is changing so fast, with model providers like Mistral, OpenAI, Cohere and others leading the charge by creating specialised Software Development Kits ( SDKs) to simplify the creation of AI Agents.", "A beeline towards unfettered implementation and adoption of AI agents integrated with language model APIs of platforms like OpenAI, Anthropic, and Cohere occurred at a blinding pace, mostly skipping centralized oversight."]</data>
