      <data key="d7">["103729", "165553"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["It’ s an approach that IBM refers to as conditional reasoning, where the step-by-step chain of thought ( CoT) reasoning is an option within the models ( as opposed to being a separate model).", "The IBM® Granite® Instruct models, for instance, are fine-tuned by using specialized training datasets composed of instructional prompts and exemplars for CoT tasks."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
