      <data key="d8">["And 61 percent of health care leaders say their primary strategy for generative AI ( GenAI) is to partner with third-parties to develop customized solutions compared to 20 percent who primarily intend to build GenAI capabilities in house, and 19 percent who primarily intend to buy off the shelf, according to a survey published in March by McKinsey &amp; Co. The solution providers who spoke with CRN said that so far, investments in AI by health care customers continue in the face of cost uncertainty as countries negotiate global tariffs."]</data>
