      <data key="d8">["CyberArk Strengthens Identity Security for AI Agents with Accenture’ s AI Refinery\nNEW YORK and NEWTON, Mass; April 10, 2025 – To help organizations implement and secure identity access controls for AI agents, CyberArk ( NASDAQ: CYBR), the global leader in identity security, is working with Accenture ( NYSE: ACN) to integrate Accenture's AI Refinery™ with its AI-powered Identity Security Platform."]</data>
