      <data key="d7">["105911", "40625"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["To address these challenges, Cloudera collaborated with Dell Technologies to allow joint customers to store all their data–structured and unstructured–in one place and access it quickly and securely.", "During the year Cloudera established strategic alliances with ServiceNow and Dell Technologies, the latter combining Cloudera software with Dell’ s ObjectScale storage system to create the Cloudera Private AI platform."]</data>
