      <data key="d8">["Dell Technologies Monday kicked off its Dell Technologies World show with a blizzard of new Dell AI Factory with Nvidia improvements, including a Dell Deskside Agentic AI product, aimed at making agentic AI more affordable than public cloud.", "Dell Technologies founder, Chairman and CEO Michael Dell and Nvidia founder and CEO Jensen Huang told thousands of Dell Technologies World attendees that the agentic AI revolution is driving dramatic gains in productivity, opening the door to a new era of “ useful AI ” for enterprise customers."]</data>
