      <data key="d8">["U.S. technology consulting leaders Accenture, Deloitte, Quantiphi and SoftServe are adopting Nvidia NIM Agent Blueprints and Nvidia NeMo and NIM microservices to help clients in healthcare, manufacturing, telecommunications, financial services and retail create custom generative AI agents and copilots.", "Nvidia executives also talked about work they were doing with Accenture, Deloitte, and Quantiphi to use the NIM Agent Blueprints and NIMs and NeMo microservices to create custom AI software and services for their own clients."]</data>
