      <data key="d8">["U.S. technology consulting leaders Accenture, Deloitte, Quantiphi and SoftServe are adopting Nvidia NIM Agent Blueprints and Nvidia NeMo and NIM microservices to help clients in healthcare, manufacturing, telecommunications, financial services and retail create custom generative AI agents and copilots.", "NVIDIA Works With Deloitte to Deploy Digital AI Agents for Healthcare\nAhead of a visit to the hospital for a surgical procedure, patients often have plenty of questions about what to expect — and can be plenty nervous.", "The first of a wave of Deloitte GenAI agent applications based on HPE Private Cloud AI was unveiled at HPE Discover Barcelona as part of an expanded collaboration agreement between Deloitte, HPE and Nvidia centered on the Nvidia AI Computing by HPE Private Cloud AI service. “"]</data>
