      <data key="d7">["178366", "62173"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["The voice AI space is becoming increasingly crowded with options ranging from proprietary models like OpenAI’ s newly released GPT-4o-transcribe family and ElevenLabs to open source solutions as well.", "Qolaba AI\nQolaba AI Studio is an all-in-one generative AI toolkit that unifies premium models from OpenAI, Anthropic, Stability AI, Google, Mistral, and ElevenLabs, enabling seamless multi-modal content creation for text, images, audio, and soon video without coding."]</data>
