      <data key="d7">["119854", "150489", "154778", "178220", "42046"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Polish-born Mati Staniszewski co-founded ElevenLabs in 2022 with Piotr Dąbkowski, inspired by poorly dubbed American sitcoms he watched growing up in Warsaw.", "Over the course of my conversation with ElevenLabs founder Mati Staniszewski at Runtime, something became clear: in addition to their voice models, the team has also mastered two other domains: space and time.", "https: //t.co/XjO6oZR7ck ElevenLabs CEO Mati Staniszewski recently tweeted out the company crossed $ 330 million in ARR at year-end 2025."]</data>
