      <data key="d7">["150489", "62173"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Qolaba AI\nQolaba AI Studio is an all-in-one generative AI toolkit that unifies premium models from OpenAI, Anthropic, Stability AI, Google, Mistral, and ElevenLabs, enabling seamless multi-modal content creation for text, images, audio, and soon video without coding.", "Just five months before the Series D closed, in September 2025, ElevenLabs had run a $ 100 million employee tender offer at a $ 6.6 billion valuation, itself more than double the $ 3.3 billion mark set by its January 2025 Series C. Founded in 2022 by childhood friends Mati Staniszewski, formerly of Palantir Technologies, and Piotr Dabkowski, a former Google machine learning engineer, ElevenLabs set out to fix something the two had complained about since they were teenagers in Warsaw: flat, poorly dubbed foreign films."]</data>
