      <data key="d8">["Learn how it simplifies GitOps workflows, reduces manual errors, and streamlines microservice deployment GKO automates API deployment and reduces manual configuration errors.", "Gravitee 4.6 - Manage Subscriptions as Code with GKO\nDiscover how GKO 4.6 expands GitOps support with new Subscription CRD With the release of Gravitee 4.6, we’ re very excited to announce Gravitee Kubernetes Operator ( GKO) 4.6 which includes two major highlights.", "With GKO, you can apply API management principles to Kafka APIs just like you would with traditional REST APIs, but now in a GitOps workflow."]</data>
