      <data key="d8">["By combining GKO with a GitOps tool like ArgoCD or FluxCD, you can have a beautifully automated pipeline that will keep your Gravitee APIs up-to-date based on the API definitions that reside in your GitHub repository.", "Gravitee 4.6 - Manage Subscriptions as Code with GKO\nDiscover how GKO 4.6 expands GitOps support with new Subscription CRD With the release of Gravitee 4.6, we’ re very excited to announce Gravitee Kubernetes Operator ( GKO) 4.6 which includes two major highlights.", "Now, let's take a look at a GKO resource for creating a native Kafka API in Gravitee."]</data>
