      <data key="d8">["&lt; &lt; “ With little to no current industry-approved governance or compliance frameworks to follow, organizations must implement the proper guardrails to innovate safely with AI, ” Anand Oswal, SVP and GM of network security at Palo Alto Networks, told VentureBeat. “", "If you think about that future where these agentic systems are going to work together to solve bigger problems, we need distributed agentic systems computing and we need an open, interoperable internet of agents, ” Vijoy Pandey, GM and SVP, Outshift by Cisco told Marshall. “", "Integration challenges hinder companies from fully realizing the technology’ s potential to create a limitless digital workforce, ” Andrew Comstock, SVP and GM of MuleSoft, told VentureBeat. “"]</data>
