      <data key="d8">["How to Use Google Lens in a Chrome Browser\nYou might have noticed Google’ s ongoing efforts to stuff artificial intelligence features into every corner of its products, and that’ s certainly the case with Chrome.", "Google is reportedly developing Project Jarvis, an AI system that would use Chrome browser to carry out web-based tasks like research, shopping, and travel booking, though this capability is still in development and hasn’ t been publicly released. “", "And Google Gemini will reportedly soon be able to take actions through the Chrome browser under an in-development agent feature dubbed Project Jarvis."]</data>
