      <data key="d7">["148372", "151288", "72462"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Google is also releasing Gemini 2.0 Flash, an experimental version of the model with “ low latency and enhanced performance at the cutting edge of our technology, at scale, ” according to Demis Hassabis, CEO of Google’ s AI research unit DeepMind, and Koray Kavukcuoglu, Google DeepMind’ s CTO. “", "To back this up, Demis Hassabis ( CEO, Google DeepMind) and Koray Kavukcuoglu ( CTO of DeepMind and Chief AI Architect at Google) presented a suite of benchmark results across text, reasoning, science and multimodal tasks.", "We are expanding Antigravity beyond a coding environment and turning it into a platform to develop and manage teams of autonomous AI agents, ” said Koray Kavukcuoglu, CTO of Google DeepMind and Chief AI Architect at Google, during a press briefing this week ahead of Google I/O 2026."]</data>
