      <data key="d8">["Artificial intelligence capabilities are coming to a desktop near you — with Microsoft 365 Copilot, Google Gemini with Project Jarvis, and Apple Intelligence all arriving ( or having arrived).", "Off-the-shelf AI agents like Microsoft 365 Copilot, OpenAI Operator, Google Gemini, and Salesforce Einstein can autonomously take actions on behalf of users, and those actions are largely built using LCNC development platforms."]</data>
