      <data key="d7">["140355", "40139", "40140", "40146", "68726", "68762", "69705", "72468", "83089"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Google Agentspace: Bringing AI agents Across Operations\nIn a landscape where information is often siloed and fragmented, organisations are seeking solutions that can unlock their collective intelligence and drive productivity.", "In addition to Agentspace, ahead of NRF, Google Cloud also shared enhancements to Vertex AI Search for commerce, which now uses advanced language models to improve product discovery.", "These innovative startups are using Google Cloud’ s AI platform, including Vertex AI, Google Kubernetes Engine ( GKE), and Agentspace, to enhance creativity, automate workflows, and elevate player immersion."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
