      <data key="d8">["Agentic ” AI, the recent buzzword of choice for tech firms, was a central focus of Google’ s annual developers conference, Google I/O. The upcoming AI agent, Gemini Spark, was one of many of the company’ s announcements from the conference Tuesday. “", "Gemini Spark is the future of Google's personal AI – but I have serious doubts about it\nWhen you purchase through links on our site, we may earn an affiliate commission.", "Google CEO Explains 6 ‘ Big’ AI And Gemini Launches At Google I/O Keynote\nFrom Google’ s new Gemini Omni and Gemini 3.5 Flash to its new Gemini Spark agent and Google Antigravity 2.0, Google CEO Sundar Pichai explains the significant innovation launched at Google I/O 2026 this week."]</data>
