      <data key="d7">["148372", "40852", "75678", "85120"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Editor’ s note: Below is an edited transcript of Google CEO Sundar Pichai’ s remarks at Google I/O 2026, adapted to include more of what was announced on stage.", "We are expanding Antigravity beyond a coding environment and turning it into a platform to develop and manage teams of autonomous AI agents, ” said Koray Kavukcuoglu, CTO of Google DeepMind and Chief AI Architect at Google, during a press briefing this week ahead of Google I/O 2026.", "From Google’ s new Gemini Omni and Gemini 3.5 Flash to the new Gemini Spark agent and Google Antigravity 2.0, Google’ s CEO weighed in on the new products launched at Google I/O 2026."]</data>
