      <data key="d8">["To that end, HPE is leaning heavily on its GreenLake hybrid cloud platform, growing software lineup, and vast hardware portfolio in hopes of gaining leverage over rivals like Dell and Cisco Systems that are all trying to come out on top in the mad AI scramble.", "HPE is infusing GreenLake with agentic AI to automate hybrid cloud and networking operations, while Extreme is pushing its Network-Infrastructure-as-a- Service model to help customers and partners avoid unpredictable CapEx costs and prepare networks for AI."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="organization:greenlake" target="organization:intel">
