      <data key="d6">3</data>
      <data key="d7">["124099", "164583", "59293"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Using all available frameworks ( MCP, A2A, LangChain, LlamaIndex, CrewAI…), AI providers ( OpenAI, Anthropic, Mistral, Groq…), and cloud providers ( GCP, AWS, Azure…), it is extremely easy to create a Proof of Concept ( PoC).", "Turns out, OpenAI is not happy with the speed at which Nvidia chips can compute inference for some ChatGPT requests, and has been looking for alternative chip providers ( such as startups Cerebras and Groq) to take on 10% of its inference", "The unified API gives you access to hundreds of LLMs through various vendors ( OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Azure, AWS, Databricks, Mistral, Groq, Together, etc.),"]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
