      <data key="d7">["140410", "40738", "51393"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["At its GTC 2026 event in San Jose, Calif., the AI infrastructure giant revealed that it plans this year to release a server rack with a new generation of the language processing unit ( LPU) it licensed from AI chip startup Groq as part of a non-exclusive deal last December.", "Nvidia Finally Admits Why It Shelled Out $ 20 Billion For Groq\nBack in late December, Nvidia did a $ 20 billion “ acquihire ” of most of the development team at Groq and licensed the technology underlying its LPU dataflow engines for doing AI inference.", "I benchmarked three providers: Groq's LPU hardware is purpose-built for inference."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
