      <data key="d6">2</data>
      <data key="d7">["131197", "140271"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["And now, nearly five decades later, Micron spans the gamut from high-capacity drives used to build data lakes, to fast drives for local storage, and various kinds of dynamic random access memory ( DRAM) – DDR, LPDDR, GDDR, and HBM – that link directly to compute engines of all kinds and literally give them the memory space to calculate.", "We have completed agreements on price and volume for our entire calendar 2026 HBM supply, including Micron's industry-leading HBM4."]</data>
