      <data key="d6">1</data>
      <data key="d7">["140271"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["To get a feel for what is going on with memory up and down the hierarchy as it relates to HPC and AI systems, we sat down with Praveen Vaidyanathan, vice president and general manager of Data Center Business at Micron, to talk about all things memory and to get some sense as to the growing demand for denser HBM memory chips and the opportunities enabled by their wider adoption.. Timothy Prickett Morgan: Let’ s start out by talking about the many kinds of DRAM that Micron makes and how they are best suited for different devices and applications in the datacenter."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
