      <data key="d7">["60229", "60238"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Home Depot is in “ get out and try mode, ” exploring the applications of agentic AI in its operations while paying close attention to how customers are using and adapting to the new features, according to the home improvement retailer’ s CIO, Angie Brown. “", "Home Depot is acting now, rather than staying in “ wait-and-see mode, ” in order to learn about how AI and its use cases will evolve, CIO Angie Brown told CX Dive at the National Retail Federation Big Show earlier this month."]</data>
