      <data key="d8">["Phanidhar Koganti, senior distinguished technologist in Hewlett Packard Enterprise ( HPE) hybrid cloud, tells The New Stack, “ Enterprises really want to get to", "In the face of enterprise IT complexity and sprawl, Phanidhar Koganti, senior distinguished technologist in Hewlett Packard Enterprise ( HPE) hybrid cloud, tells The New Stack that ops is entering its “ Agentic Era, ” where AI agents have specialized knowledge, capabilities, and workflows, referred to as agent skills.", "And you might not want to make a lot of changes when there are a lot of issues going on, ” Phanidhar Koganti, senior distinguished technologist in Hewlett Packard Enterprise ( HPE) hybrid cloud, tells The New Stack."]</data>
