      <data key="d8">["Discover KPMG's innovative journey with Microsoft.", "AI, Compa, Deloitte, Glean, Google Cloud, IBM, Kainos, KPMG, Microsoft, Paradox, PwC, and WorkBoardAI are among the first to partner with Workday to help joint customers thrive in a future where AI agents are a central part of how work gets done.", "Developed in collaboration with Microsoft, KPMG Workbench empowers KPMG professionals with the support of trusted, intelligent AI agents to accelerate innovation for clients and complement human expertise."]</data>
