      <data key="d7">["110314", "74113"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["It brings together insights from KPMG professionals and industry leaders from Zurich Australia, Generali Italia, PassportCard, and Prudential who share their perspectives on how to unlock AI's full potential.", "Developed with input from practitioners and advisory board members across organizations including Citi, JPMorgan Chase, Microsoft, KPMG, Deloitte, NTT Data, GE Healthcare, GlobalLogic, Prudential and Salesforce, the ADG Framework gives enterprises a unified operating model; three pillars, 12 minimum controls, and nine governance surfaces."]</data>
