      <data key="d8">["New York, NY – OCT 24 – KPMG LLP, a global leader in Audit, Tax, and Advisory services announced a minority equity investment in Ema, an agentic AI startup building universal AI employees.", "In this episode of You can with AI, NLW is joined by Edwige Sacco, Head of Workforce Innovation at KPMG LLP, and Surojit Chatterjee, Founder and CEO of Ema, for a conversation about what changes when organizations stop treating AI as software and start treating it as part of the team."]</data>
