      <data key="d7">["113256", "140336", "148370", "70346", "97387"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Agentgateway comes to The Linux Foundation already supporting A2A and the Model Context Protocol ( MCP) developed by Anthropic, the company behind the Claude LLM, as a standard for allow agents to connect with external systems and share data from a broad range of sources.", "MCP is an open standard that allows AI models to interact with external data and systems, originally released by Anthropic and donated in December 2025 to the Linux Foundation's Agentic AI Foundation.", "A2A ( the agent-to-agent protocol Google contributed to the Linux Foundation) handles agent-to-agent communication while MCP handles agent-to-tool calls."]</data>
