      <data key="d8">["Microsoft unveils Microsoft Security Copilot agents and new protections for AI\nIn this age of AI, securing AI and using it to boost security are crucial for every organization.", "This diagram illustrates the Microsoft Sentinel AI-first, end-to-end SIEM and security platform, highlighting its core components and its integration with Microsoft Security Copilot.", "To make it easier to harness the power of these agents and get started more quickly, we are excited to announce that Microsoft Security Copilot will be included for all Microsoft 365 E5 customers. *"]</data>
