      <data key="d7">["51592"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["The US Government Just Made AI Agent Governance a National Priority\nPosted on May 7 • Originally published at aguardic.com On Monday, NIST's Center for AI Standards and Innovation launched the AI Agent Standards Initiative — a coordinated federal effort to develop security standards, identity frameworks, and interoperability protocols for autonomous AI agents."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
