      <data key="d8">["NVIDIA AI Summit Highlights Game-Changing Energy Efficiency and AI-Driven Innovation\nAccelerated computing is sustainable computing, Bob Pette, NVIDIA’ s vice president and general manager of enterprise platforms, explained in a keynote at the NVIDIA AI Summit on Tuesday in Washington, D.C. NVIDIA’ s accelerated computing isn’ t just efficient.", "The latest AI-accelerated tools — on display at the NVIDIA AI Summit taking place this week in Washington, D.C. — include NVIDIA NIM, a collection of cloud-native microservices that support AI model deployment and execution, and NVIDIA NIM Agent Blueprints, a catalog of pretrained, customizable workflows."]</data>
