      <data key="d8">["Enterprises can use new Nvidia DGX GB300 and Nvidia DGX B300 systems, integrated with Nvidia networking, to deliver out-of-the-box DGX SuperPOD AI supercomputers that offer FP4 precision and faster AI reasoning to supercharge token generation for AI applications.", "Enterprises can use new NVIDIA DGX GB300 and NVIDIA DGX B300 systems, integrated with NVIDIA networking, to deliver out-of-the-box DGX SuperPOD AI supercomputers that offer FP4 precision and faster AI reasoning to supercharge token generation for AI applications.", "Nvidia plans to integrate its Blackwell Ultra GPUs into two DGX systems: the Nvidia DGX GB300 and the Nvidia DGX B300."]</data>
