      <data key="d8">["10 Big Nvidia GTC 2025 Announcements: Blackwell Ultra, Rubin Ultra, DGX Spark And More\nWith Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang asserting that the tech industry needs 100 times more computation than what was needed a year ago due to the rise of reasoning models, the AI leader presented at the company’ s GTC 2025 event how it will fulfill those needs with increasingly powerful AI computing platforms, networking gear and software.", "AMD also gave a teaser for the MI500 series GPUs and associated products that will go against Nvidia’ s Rubin Ultra platform in 2027."]</data>
