      <data key="d8">["Huang unveiled Rubin, NVIDIA’ s first extreme-codesigned, six-chip AI platform now in full production, and introduced Alpamayo, an open reasoning model family for autonomous vehicle development — part of a sweeping push to bring AI into every domain.", "Nvidia’ s open models hit on all of those industries, with examples being Cosmos for physical AI, Alpamayo for autonomous vehicles, BioNeMo for biology, and Nemotron 3, the latest set of multi-modal models for multi-agent systems. “", "Nvidia has also been growing its family of open source AI models, from Nemotron for agentic AI and Cosmos for physical AI to Gr00t ( robotics), BioNeMo ( biomedical research), Apollo ( AI physics), and Alpamayo ( autonomous vehicles)."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
