      <data key="d8">["This is why SambaNova Systems and the first generation of AI hardware startups are still in the game, despite the hegemony of the Nvidia GPU in the AI datacenter, and it is also why the company was able o raise $ 350 million in Series E funding to help build and push its new “ Cerulean 2 ” SN50 reconfigurable data unit ( RDU) compute engine for AI processing.", "Third, people started figuring out that very expensive GPU clusters made by Nvidia were very good at batching up inference work with reasonable response times for chattybots, but some of those exotic machines created by Cerebras and rivals Groq and SambaNova Systems and loaded up with SRAM cache and not so dependent on HBM stacked memory,"]</data>
