      <data key="d6">4</data>
      <data key="d7">["118951", "123722", "178332", "73822"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Omniverse is an operating system that connects the world’ s physical data to the realm of physical AI, ” said Rev Lebaredian, vice president of Omniverse simulation technology at Nvidia, in a statement. “", "Nvidia’ s vice president of Omniverse and simulation technology Rev Lebaredian thinks robots could account for over half a million open manufacturing jobs. “", "Physical AI is the next phase of computing — where intelligence is trained, tested and validated in simulation before it operates in the real world, ” said Rev Lebaredian, VP of Omniverse and simulation technologies at NVIDIA. “"]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
