      <data key="d8">["With 2025 hailed as “ the year of agents ” by NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang and OpenAI CPO Kevin Weil, AI agents are increasingly of interest to organizations across industries.", "OpenAI showed the world what could be built on NVIDIA AI — and now they’ re advancing innovation in open-source software, ” said Jensen Huang, founder and CEO of NVIDIA. “", "Sam Altman Expects to Get What He Wants\nOn Monday, two of AI’ s biggest players had a little public tiff that started with a well-sourced report from Reuters that OpenAI is dissatisfied with Nvidia’ s chips and ended in OpenAI CEO Sam Altman tweeting, “ I don’ t get where all this insanity is coming from, ” after Nvidia’ s top exec Jensen Huang publicly wavered on its investments in the maker of ChatGPT."]</data>
