      <data key="d7">["140356", "167718", "80695"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["At Oracle AI World, Oracle today announced a new OCI Zettascale10 computing cluster accelerated by NVIDIA GPUs, designed for high-performance AI inference and training workloads.", "It is a message that Oracle co-founder and chief technology officer Larry Ellison has been delivering for well over a year, and it’ s an argument that he made this week during his 90-plus minute keynote at this week’ s Oracle AI World 2025 conference in Las Vegas – a show that used to be Oracle CloudWorld from 2022 through 2024, and Oracle OpenWorld between 1997 and 2021, and used to be an independent Oracle user group before that.", "Oracle AI World 2025: PwC\nAs the exclusive Global Value Driver sponsor of Oracle AI World, PwC showed how AI and Oracle technology can move businesses forward so you can make faster, smarter decisions that drive growth."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
