      <data key="d8">["Other announcements include added support for NVIDIA NIM microservices in Oracle Database 26ai, NVIDIA accelerated computing integration in the new Oracle AI Data Platform, native availability of the NVIDIA AI Enterprise software platform in the OCI Console and more. “", "Oracle Launches AI Data Platform to Unify Enterprise Data and Generative AI\nOracle announced the general availability of Oracle AI Data Platform, a comprehensive platform designed to help customers securely connect industry-leading generative AI models with their enterprise data, applications, and workflows."]</data>
