      <data key="d7">["97311", "97429"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Bringing together the latest innovations of Red Hat AI Inference Server, Red Hat Enterprise Linux AI ( RHEL AI) and Red Hat OpenShift AI, the platform helps simplify the complexities of high-performance AI inference at scale, enabling organizations to more readily move workloads from proofs-of-concept to production and improve collaboration around AI-enabled applications.", "It joins the Red Hat AI portfolio which includes Red Hat AI Inference Server, Red Hat OpenShift AI and Red Hat Enterprise Linux AI."]</data>
