      <data key="d7">["97387", "97484"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Smarter troubleshooting with the new MCP server for Red Hat Enterprise Linux ( now in developer preview)\nBuild, deploy, and monitor AI models and apps.", "Address IT skills gaps and solve issues faster with Model Context Protocol ( MCP) server for Red Hat Enterprise Linux, Red Hat Satellite, and Red Hat Lightspeed."]</data>
