      <data key="d8">["Learn More SAP made a big bet on AI agents at its annual TechEd conference, infusing the technology with its gen AI copilot, Joule.", "SAP ‘ Supercharging’ Joule AI Copilot With New Agent Capabilities\nHolding its TechEd Virtual event this week, the software giant is also significantly expanding its SAP Build development tools offerings and debuting new Knowledge Graph software for Joule to provide data context for AI tasks.", "SAP has launched collaborative AI agents in Joule, its generative AI copilot, as a further effort to provide deeper integrations across its software ecosystem. “"]</data>
