      <data key="d8">["Secure your spot now - space is limited: https: //bit.ly/3GuuPLF Data and AI platform leaders Cadence, Cloudera, DataStax, Google Cloud, NetApp, SAP, ServiceNow and Teradata are advancing their data and AI platforms with Nvidia NIM. “", "Salesforce has Agentforce, ServiceNow has its agent, SAP and everybody else is coming with their agents, ” Hodjat ( pictured) told CRN. “", "Partnering with more than 50 companies, including Atlassian, Box, Cohere, Intuit, LangChain, MongoDB, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow, UKG and Workday, Agent2Agent aims to be the interoperability language for agents and AI applications."]</data>
