      <data key="d8">["This represents a great opportunity to get more value out of your enterprise data, and take advantage of the longstanding partnership between Google Cloud and SAP.", "Google Cloud at SAP Sapphire 2025\nSAP and Google Cloud are deepening their collaboration across data analytics, AI, security, and more to deliver what customers need most: faster paths to business value, lower risk on complex projects, and smart, enterprise-ready innovation that’ s built to serve real workloads — not hypothetical use cases.", "Our partnerships with leading innovators, including SAP, Oracle, AWS, Google Cloud, Microsoft, Workday, Guidewire, Adobe, OpenAI and Anthropic are driving the development of cutting-edge, industry-specific solutions that help clients transform and grow with confidence."]</data>
