      <data key="d7">["40053", "40204", "40488", "40526", "40584", "40760"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Among the other CEO respondents from top cybersecurity vendors were Palo Alto Networks CEO Nikesh Arora, CrowdStrike CEO George Kurtz, SentinelOne CEO Tomer Weingarten and Wiz CEO Assaf Rappaport.", "SentinelOne CEO On Why AI Agents May Be A ‘ Transient Concept’\nIn an interview with CRN, SentinelOne CEO Tomer Weingarten says that while agentic capabilities are promising, partners need to stay ‘ agile and flexible enough to support what comes next’ even beyond the technology.", "SentinelOne CEO On ‘ Tremendous’ AI Opportunity For MSSPs, Doubling Down On Partner Program\nThe cybersecurity vendor is looking to get even more aggressive in its work with the channel in the coming year with expanded incentives and a massive push around delivering advanced AI-powered security, SentinelOne CEO Tomer Weingarten says during an interview with CRN."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
