      <data key="d7">["154197", "40154", "68881"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Partnering with more than 50 companies, including Atlassian, Box, Cohere, Intuit, LangChain, MongoDB, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow, UKG and Workday, Agent2Agent aims to be the interoperability language for agents and AI applications.", "Google Cloud’ s new Agent2Agent protocol enables AI agents to communicate with each other, securely exchange information and coordinate actions across various platforms or services like Atlassian, Box, Cohere, Intuit, LangChain, MongoDB, PayPal, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow, UKG and Workday.", "A2A is a collaborative effort to standardize agent interoperability with contributions from a growing ecosystem of 50+ partners including Box, Deloitte, Elastic, Salesforce, ServiceNow, UiPath, UKG, and many more."]</data>
