      <data key="d7">["140336", "146252", "154197", "40154", "52888", "68881"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Partnering with more than 50 companies, including Atlassian, Box, Cohere, Intuit, LangChain, MongoDB, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow, UKG and Workday, Agent2Agent aims to be the interoperability language for agents and AI applications.", "To address this, Deloitte is working with Google Cloud and ServiceNow to advance Agent2Agent ( A2A) — Google Cloud’ s new open standard for agent interoperability, which enables successful communication between agents across platforms and services.", "Google Cloud’ s new Agent2Agent protocol enables AI agents to communicate with each other, securely exchange information and coordinate actions across various platforms or services like Atlassian, Box, Cohere, Intuit, LangChain, MongoDB, PayPal, Salesforce, SAP, ServiceNow, UKG and Workday."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
