      <data key="d8">["Synopsys and Ansys power the future of innovation—connecting silicon to systems.", "Synopsys Executive: Nvidia Deal Will Help Partners ‘ Solve Larger Problems Faster’\nSynopsys executive Steve Pytel explains to CRN how channel partners will benefit from its new blockbuster alliance with Nvidia, which is expected to result in an overhaul of its products, including the analysis and simulation applications gained through its Ansys acquisition.", "Synopsys announced Multiphysics Fusion technology and the first wave of EDA solutions that integrate Ansys golden multiphysics engines into Synopsys ' leading EDA portfolio to solve today's pressing chip design problems caused by electromagnetics, thermal, and mechanical effects."]</data>
