      <data key="d7">["140270", "165385", "178336", "40515", "40562", "40614", "85621"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Blackwell, the engine of AI, has arrived for PC gamers, developers and creatives, ” said Huang. “", "Here it is — our brand-new GeForce RTX 50 series, Blackwell architecture, ” Huang said, holding the blacked-out GPU aloft and noting how it’ s able to harness advanced AI to enable breakthrough graphics. “", "The centerpiece of Nvidia’ s AI computing strategy, the Blackwell platform, is now in “ full production, ” according to Huang, who emphasized that “ customer demand is incredible. ”"]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
