      <data key="d7">["168780"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["In this transformative moment of AI, where scaling laws are pushing the limits of data center capabilities, our latest NVIDIA Blackwell-powered solutions, developed through close collaboration with NVIDIA, deliver outstanding computational power, ” said Charles Liang, president and CEO of Supermicro. “"]</data>
