      <data key="d8">["With tools like low-code Agent Studio, support for Agent Development Kit ( ADK), and protocols like A2A and MCP, Agent Platform is the key to building, scaling and optimizing agents across the entire organization.", "This intermediate-level track will guide you through building distributed multi-agent systems using Google's Agent Development Kit ( ADK), Agent2Agent Protocol ( A2A), and Cloud Run.", "Multi-Agent A2A with the Agent Development Kit ( ADK), Azure Fabric, and Gemini CLI\nPosted on May 4 • Originally published at xbill999.Medium on May 4 Leveraging the Google Agent Development Kit ( ADK) and the underlying Gemini LLM to build Multi-Agent Applications with A2A protocol support using the Python programming language."]</data>
