      <data key="d7">["52349", "52350"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["The recently released AI model, Kimi K2 from Moonshot AI, is an open-source model that many consider a viable alternative to Claude Sonnet 4.", "✨🤔\nPosted on Jul 23, 2025 • Originally published at composio.dev Moonshot AI ( a Chinese Artificial Intelligence company) recently announced their new AI model, Kimi K2, which is an open-source model purposely built for agentic tasks, and some even consider this model an alternative and open-source version of the Claude Sonnet 4 model."]</data>
