      <data key="d7">["148104", "148190", "148344", "148386"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["For over 15 years, Kin Lane, co-founder and chief community officer ( CCO) for open source API foundation Naftiko, has been building his expertise in APIs — not only the technical details but also the business angle.", "Kin Lane, co-founder and chief community officer ( CCO) for the open-source API company Naftiko, sees the mitigation of agentic risk in systems-thinking terms.", "When I recently talked to Kin Lane, API evangelist and co-founder of Naftiko, I was repeatedly struck by the parallels between what we’ re seeing with GenAI adoption and what we saw with the migration from private data centers to public cloud."]</data>
      <data key="d9">same_sentence_entity_cooccurrence</data>
    </edge>
