      <data key="d7">["150489", "33127"]</data>
      <data key="d8">["Just five months before the Series D closed, in September 2025, ElevenLabs had run a $ 100 million employee tender offer at a $ 6.6 billion valuation, itself more than double the $ 3.3 billion mark set by its January 2025 Series C. Founded in 2022 by childhood friends Mati Staniszewski, formerly of Palantir Technologies, and Piotr Dabkowski, a former Google machine learning engineer, ElevenLabs set out to fix something the two had complained about since they were teenagers in Warsaw: flat, poorly dubbed foreign films.", "ㅤGrowing up in Poland in the early 2000s, Mati Staniszewski and Piotr Dabkowski couldn’ t stand the poorly dubbed movies they had to sit through."]</data>
