      <data key="d8">["You can also build through AI-powered experiences, including Wix Harmony, or even connect Wix to tools like Claude and ChatGPT via the Wix MCP server to generate and manage websites using natural language.", "The Wix MCP server exposes core Wix capabilities, like site creation, store management, bookings and payments, as structured tools that AI systems can call directly.", "The Wix MCP server allows users to build, manage and operate Wix sites, stores and bookings directly through natural language prompts, without needing to access the dashboard."]</data>
