      <data key="d8">["You can also build through AI-powered experiences, including Wix Harmony, or even connect Wix to tools like Claude and ChatGPT via the Wix MCP server to generate and manage websites using natural language.", "With the Wix MCP built directly into Claude as a first-party integration, you can turn a conversation into a fully functional, hosted Wix Harmony site, without the need for code, templates or switching between tools.", "The first path's home is Wix Harmony, a hybrid editor that pairs that in-house model with full manual, drag and drop control; the sections further down on Claude, ChatGPT and the Wix MCP cover the second."]</data>
