      <data key="d8">["From Docker Desktop to leading MCP clients like Docker AI Agent, Claude, continue.dev, Cursor, Goose, VS Code, and Windsurf, integrating powerful and capable AI agents into real workflows is about to get a whole lot easier.", "Dodd showed an e-commerce demo of MCP-UI being used to display a user interface inside VS Code. “", "From IDEs like VS Code, Cursor and JetBrains to AI agent frameworks like LangGraph, CrewAI, AWS’ strands, and Google’ s Agent Development Kit ( ADK), MCP is set to become a foundational layer for AI-native workflows."]</data>
