      <data key="d8">["The new protocol uses existing structured data formats like RSS, and each NLWeb instance functions as an MCP server. “", "NLWeb supports all major operating systems, AI models, and vector databases, and integrates with the Model Context Protocol ( MCP) ecosystem for broader agent compatibility.", "MCP, A2A, NLWeb, And AGENTS.md: The Standards Powering The Agentic Web\nRegister now and come ready to rethink how you're allocating AI search effort."]</data>
